{
    "title": "Local Weather Forecast - Radar",
    "description": "This free weather app offers all the features: weather forecast for current location, manually added city weather forecast, weather forecast for up to 120 hours, weather forecast for up to 45 days, advanced rainfall forecast accurate to the minute, multiple types of weather radar, timely weather alerts, various styles of weather widgets, custom notification bar, beautiful themes, colorful weather background.\r\n\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014 Main Features \u2014\u2014\u2014\r\n\r\n\u2600\ufe0fRealtime local weather\r\n- After the user allows the weather forecast application to obtain the location permission, it will automatically track your location information and accurately display the real-time weather forecast.\r\n- If you don't want to give the app location permission, you can manually search and add any city to the city list to view the real-time weather information of the city.\r\n- Includes real-time weather conditions, temperature, pressure, pollen count, precipitation, UV index, humidity, visibility, sunrise and sunset.\r\n\r\n\u2744\ufe0fHourly / Daily Forecast\r\n-  Get real-time weather forecast, temperature information, air quality pollution index, and weather briefing for your current location\r\n- Detailed weather information for the next 25 days, precipitation, precipitation probability, wind direction, temperature, temperature change trend, air quality forecast, and an overview of weather information for each day\r\n- 24-hour weather forecast, comfort index, pollen index, allergy index, UV index, wind level, wind direction\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf2a Air quality forecast\r\n- Query hourly air quality and air pollution, PM2.5 index and AQI index information in the next 5 days\r\n- Real-time monitoring of air quality, care for health and comprehensive escort\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca6Meteorological disaster warning\r\nTimely reminder of abnormal weather conditions to help you take precautions in time\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf26Weather & Clock Widgets\r\n\u00a0- Support for Widgets of various sizes \r\n\u00a0- Provide a variety of different sizes of desktop weather themes, you can check the weather when you open your phone\r\n\r\n \ud83c\udf0f Weather radar map\r\n- Live weather radar with animated maps\r\n- Weather maps enabled with GPS, live radar, temperature radar, rain radar, wind radar, atmospheric pressure radar, etc.\r\n- A clear radar chart shows precipitation trends, providing accurate weather forecast trends to protect your travel\r\n\r\n\u2699\ufe0f Customize weather channels and unit settings\r\n\u00a0- Local Conditions: Access to local weather conditions, weather report\r\n\u00a0- Weather Widgets: Beautiful background picture and Choose a different city\r\n\u00a0- Temperature Unit: Fahrenheit (\u00b0 F) or Celsius (\u00b0 C)\r\n\u00a0- Wind Speed Unit: m / s, mph, km / h\r\n - Date format: yyyy/mm/dd,  dd/mm/yyyy, mm/dd/yyyy\r\n - Hour format: 12-hour, 24-hour\r\n - Pressure: bar, hPa, mmHg, atm\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf07 Sunrise and sunset \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f City list for easy management and visual display\r\n- The weather for cities you care about is displayed as a list. You can manually add, delete, adjust the order, and also set default cities and weather forecasts for notifications, widgets.\r\n- Available in the world's most popular cities for travelers: Barcelona, Osaka,  Agra,  Los Angeles , Shanghai , Pattaya, Seoul,  Amsterdam, Miami, Mecca, Saudi Arabia, Prague,  Mumbai ,Taipei,  Antalya , Rome ,Tokyo , New York City, Dubai, Paris,  Singapore , London, Bangkok , Hong Kong\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf10 Support multiple languages\r\n  English,\u09ac\u09be\u0982\u09b2\u09be,Dansk,Deutsch,Espa\u00f1ol,Fran\u00e7ais,\u0939\u093f\u0902\u0926\u0940,Italiano,\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e,\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4,\u092e\u0930\u093e\u0920\u0940,Melayu,Nederlands,Norsk,Portugu\u00eas,Svenska,\u0ba4\u0bae\u0bbf\u0bb4\u0bcd,\u0c24\u0c46\u0c32\u0c41\u0c17\u0c41\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf08 Others \r\n -  You can choose different notification bar styles, for example, display 24-hour weather on the notification bar, or seven-day weather information, or only display the current weather information\r\n\u00a0-  Support manual search for global city weather information\r\n\u00a0-  Support users to select the city to display from the map \r\n\r\n \r\n\u00a0 Welcome to download this completely free professional accurate weather forecast application. \r\n\u00a0 If you have any questions during use, please give us feedback.\r\nEmail: vitalityappstudios@gmail.com",
